msgstr "Yuva ha eliminat el seu testimoni i ja no pot llegir {provider}."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it at Microsoft. In your Microsoft account, open Privacy › Apps and services, choose Yuva and remove its permissions."
msgstr "Yuva ha eliminat el seu testimoni però no el pot revocar a Microsoft. Al teu compte de Microsoft, obre Privacy › Apps and services, tria Yuva i elimina'n els permisos."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it at Microsoft. Remove Yuva from your work account in My Apps; an admin removes it for everyone in the Microsoft Entra admin center › Enterprise applications."
msgstr "Yuva ha eliminat el seu testimoni però no el pot revocar a Microsoft. Elimina Yuva del teu compte de feina a My Apps; un administrador l'elimina per a tothom al centre d'administració de Microsoft Entra › Enterprise applications."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it in Help Scout. Delete the app in Your Profile › My Apps; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva ha eliminat el seu testimoni però no el pot revocar a Help Scout. Elimina l'aplicació a Your Profile › My Apps; Yuva ja no la necessita."

#: src/features/migrations/DoneStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deleted its token but cannot revoke it in Zendesk. Delete the client in Admin Center › Apps and integrations › APIs › OAuth clients; Yuva does not need it any more."
msgstr "Yuva ha eliminat el seu testimoni però no el pot revocar a Zendesk. Elimina el client a Admin Center › Apps and integrations › APIs › OAuth clients; Yuva ja no el necessita."

#: src/features/migrations/SignInConnectStep.tsx
msgid "Yuva deletes its token when the migration ends."
msgstr "Yuva elimina el seu testimoni quan acaba la migració."

